  "10:04am",
  "She gets angry and says she already",
  "showered, even when she hasn't.",
  "iSupport Assistant",
  "That sounds really difficult. Many",
  "carers experience similar situations,",
  "and it can feel frustrating when",
  "you're trying to help but it leads to",
  "distress.",
  "10:06am",
  "Sometimes this happens because",
  "dementia can affect memory and",
  "awareness, so your mum may truly",
  "believe she has already showered.",
  "There's a short iSupport lesson that",
  "explains why this happens and",
  "shows gentle ways to approach",
  "situations like bathing, including a",
  "video with practical tips.",
  "Would you like me to guide you to it?",
